Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.73,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¿Te acaba de pasar\Nalgo épico en GTA 6?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:04.67,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Así lo guardas\Nen segundos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:07.23,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}En PS5, pulsa\Nel botón Crear y
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.25,0:00:09.57,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}elige guardar el\Njuego reciente.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:12.42,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}La consola guarda lo\Nque acaba de pasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:15.57,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}En Xbox, mantén pulsado\Nel botón Compartir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.59,0:00:17.88,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}para grabar lo que\Nacaba de pasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:20.37,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Una pulsación corta\Nhace una captura.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:21.28,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Truco:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:23.37,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}en los ajustes de\Ncapturas puedes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.39,0:00:25.40,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}elegir la duración\Ny la calidad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:28.27,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Y antes de compartirlo,\Npiensa en los spoilers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:30.28,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Etiquétanos en tus clips.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:32.23,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Los mejores salen\Nen el canal.
